<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道2.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>No way... are you telling me that was my imagination too...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My feet stopped completely, and even though I was recovering from the exhaustion, my breathing went ragged.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
White breath and white snow, and the voice I wanted to believe I had only imagined hearing, blocked my view.<PG>
Ridiculous! That kind of occult stuff can't possibly exist!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ghosts and monsters... there's no way things like that are real!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I summoned all my willpower, straightened up―.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then I slowly turned around once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\dark_attack.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\雪道3.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just as before, there was no one there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ha, hahaha...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right, it's just my imagination...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm just a little tired...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Telling myself that was the only way I could keep my sanity.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
Just then...<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_ohoshisama2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "アイテム1" "QUAKE" "1" "10" "15" "0" "30"}
From my phone, a discordant ringtone I had never heard before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\2okyou.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Eerie, low-voiced sutra chanting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\カメラ霊.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
And the sound of a photo being taken.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
Not understanding anything anymore, I threw my phone away and ran as fast as I could.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―When I came to, I was at my own house.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouted from the entryway, but there was no answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not just <STYLE ID="2">Sis</STYLE>; my parents weren't home either.<PG>
Ah, alone again...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never thought the day would come when staying home alone, which I should have been used to, would feel this scary.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I went into my room and, without even turning on the light, threw myself face-down on the bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just want to fall asleep like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And then greet the morning, and laugh off what happened as a dream.<PG>
I had thrown my phone away; what excuse would I give my parents?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way an excuse like "I threw it away because a ghost showed up" would work―.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
While I was fretting over this and that...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
From somewhere in the room, an impossible sound―
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\和の廃墟.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I heard a phone buzzing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And from inside my bag, no less.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was sure I had thrown it away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm not in the habit of putting my phone in my bag; I always keep it in my pocket.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Impossible, in two ways.<PG>
Hahaha... 
{PAUSE ""}
Yeah, I'm just <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="・・・・">not myself</STYLE> today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way ghosts exist.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the phone, I just tossed it into my bag because I'd lost my head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somebody must have just sent me an email or a message.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Okay, I have to check it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Holding my trembling hands steady, I took out the phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure enough, the phone was in my bag.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's more, it was a little <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE>, with leftover snow clinging to it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
It looked like an email had come after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come on, check the email, me!<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">“This is a drill. As part of Motoki-cho's disaster preparedness, this test message is being sent to everyone.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hahaha... 
{PAUSE ""}
A test message this late at night is way too annoying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hahaha... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hahaha...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Inside, I let out a loud laugh of <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="あんど">relief</STYLE>.<PG>
Come to think of it―
{PAUSE ""}
when I thought I'd thrown the phone away, there had been the sound of a photo being taken.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I must have taken some weird photo by mistake.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If it came out funny, it would at least make a good story.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I opened the photo data―.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What? This is..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There...<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\恐怖BGM2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Next to my face, there was a terrifying face, I couldn't tell whether human or monster.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And my face was horribly <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ゆが">distorted</STYLE>, as if it were being eaten away by that face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even after that, I was too scared to touch the photo, and I couldn't delete it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくの明かり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's the end of my story."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"Ha, hahaha... Not bad. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">If you had that photo, it would've been real scary, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The story's over, but I do have the photo. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll show it to you and wrap things up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\怪談テーブル.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくフィルター.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,アイテム2,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "625" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MOTION "789" "アイテム1" "4" "100" "0" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> set her phone on the table.<PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"G-</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">Don't tell me that phone has the photo on it...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's still on here. I haven't looked at it since then either, I'm too scared. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'll bring up the photo now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> started fiddling with her phone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間暗い.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ろうそくの明かり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"S-s-s-stop it! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="8">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">G-g-g-Grandma</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="8">This isn't allowed, right!? It's against the rules, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Y-y-y-yeah! Let's stop now, okay? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="10">　We'll say </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="10"> wins!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物3" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ五島ツインテールバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, we're still in the middle of a ghost story. Quiet down."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">"No way...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Kana-chan</STYLE> were clinging to each other, trembling all over.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム2,人物3,人物2,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This is the photo..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> quietly set the phone in the middle of the table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What it showed was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\五島携帯幽霊1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "5000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A blurry, bloodstained face with a terrifying look.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And that face, as if forcing its way into the face of a terror-stricken <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>, was <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ゆが">distorted</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Natsumi-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Chiga-nee</STYLE> grabbed my sleeve.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is no ghost story...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's real...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Don't you notice something about this photo?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"What do you mean, something...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Come on, take a good look. You're sure to notice."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
