<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> flashed a big grin.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="12">... how are you okay with this...? </STYLE>
